        "original_id": "2bf8cf39-8ddc-59a8-871c-322847f36d5a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Felix Salten\n- Products: Bambi, a Life in the Woods; Bambi's Children\n- Places: Vienna; Austria\n- Companies: Ullstein Verlag\n\nFacts:\n- Felix Salten was born on 6 September 1869 and died on 8 October 1945.\n- Felix Salten was an Austrian author and critic in Vienna.\n- In 1923, Felix Salten wrote the Austrian novel Bambi, a Life in the Woods, which was originally published in Austria as Bambi: Eine Lebensgeschichte aus dem Walde.\n- Ullstein Verlag published Bambi, a Life in the Woods.\n- Felix Salten wrote Bambi's Children: The Story of a Forest Family as a sequel to Bambi, a Life in the Woods.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
